'''Nazousagi''' (ナゾウサギ) is a [[:Category:Dark Enemies|Dark]] enemy that appears in the [[Nazousagi Collaboration Event]]. They were added in [[Version 5.8 Update|Version 5.8]].

{{Enemy Info
|name = Nazousagi
|image = E 314.png
|appearance = [[Nazousagi Collaboration Event]]
|money drop = 500円 - 1,975円
}}

==Enemy==
A black rabbit with red eyes and grey-ish ears. Its weapon is a stained sign with a message written in Japanese. It moves at a decent speed and has high range and a fast attack rate. These would make it dangerous if not for its not-so-high DPS and health. On top of that, it also appears at low magnifications in most of its stages, meaning it won't be much of a threat for players past [[Empire of Cats]].

==Strategy==
The easiest way to beat it is simply by stacking [[Salon Cat (Rare Cat)|Paris Cat]] and high health [[:Category:Meatshield-class Cats|meatshields]], such as [[Tank Cat (Normal Cat)|Wall Cat]], or [[Crazed Tank Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Crazed Wall Cat]]. If you have the unit from the collab, [[Nazousagi (Special Cat)|Nazousagi]], you could also use that, as it outranges this enemy and deals [[Massive Damage]] to it.

